---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How long does a typical build take?',
    a: 'Starter Builds usually launch in 1-2 weeks once content and assets are ready. Custom Projects vary by scope, and you will get a timeline after the discovery call.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you design, or only develop?',
    a: 'We handle both, but we can also build from an existing Figma/design file if you already have one you like.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I edit the site myself after launch?',
    a: 'Yes. Every build ships with a CMS setup and a short editor walkthrough so your team can update content without touching code.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you only build websites, or handle SEO and social media too?',
    a: 'All three. Most clients start with a website build and add SEO or social media marketing once the site is live, but you can bring us in for any of the three on its own.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I only need ongoing small changes?',
    a: 'That is exactly what the Ongoing Support retainer is for: a fixed monthly hour block instead of one-off invoices for every small request.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work with businesses outside the Philippines?',
    a: 'Yes. We are Philippines based but work with clients across time zones. Most communication happens over email or chat, plus a weekly call.',
  },
];
---

<section class="faq section" id="faq">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow-warm" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>FAQ</p>
    <h2 class="faq-title warm-title" data-reveal>Questions, answered<br />before you ask.</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {
        faqs.map((f) => (
          <details class="faq-item" data-reveal>
            <summary>
              <span>{f.q}</span>
              <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>
            <p>{f.a}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    background: var(--a-bg);
  }

  .faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .faq-list {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: var(--a-card);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -30px var(--a-shadow);
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--a-ink);
  }

  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-icon {
    position: relative;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .faq-icon::before,
  .faq-icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--a-coral);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-bounce);
  }

  .faq-icon::before {
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .faq-icon::after {
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 2px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon::after {
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    padding-bottom: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--a-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
</style>
